cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this framework, please cite it.
title: "How Regulatory Order Reaches Actors: A Three-Module Framework"
abstract: >-
  A framework for tracing how regulatory order forms and reaches actors across
  AI-related value chains. Two independent classification axes — Instability (conditions) and
  Formation History (events) — plus a downstream module describing transmission,
  distribution, and re-formation once an order exists.
type: software
